  "statement_nl": "For integers A,B,d with A >= B >= 0 and d >= 0, define Q_{A,B,d}(q) := prod_{i=1}^d (1 - q^(A+i)) / (1 - q^(B+i)); when d = 0 the empty product is 1.",
